_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 13
---
order: 13
---
short_label: V.13
---
statement: If a first magnitude has to a second the same ratio as a third to a fourth, and the third has to the fourth a greater ratio than a fifth has to a sixth, then the first also has to the second a greater ratio than the fifth to the sixth.
---
proof:

---
